* The Euler factor of Lemma 3.3(a) at a prime dividing both R and S: hPrime ( p ) = ( p - 1 ) ^ 2 - 1 = p ( p - 2 ), so 1 + hPrime ( p ) / p = p - 1 (Lean sum_hBV_div_eq, the case r = r').

